.
.  Generate sample output for Uniform PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na unipdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Uniform PDF
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Probability Density
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT UNIPDF(X) FOR X = 0 0.1 1
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv unipdf.jpg ../gif100/unipdf.jpg
system cp UNIPDF.PS unipdf.ps
system rm UNIPDF.PS
.
quit
